Output docs/screenshots/board.gif

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 15
Set Width 1400
Set Height 860
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 80ms

Type "bdw"
Enter
Sleep 2s
Screenshot docs/screenshots/board-status.png

Type "e"
Sleep 1s
Screenshot docs/screenshots/board-epic.png

Type "s"
Sleep 500ms
Type "j"
Sleep 300ms
Enter
Sleep 1s
Screenshot docs/screenshots/detail.png
Sleep 1500ms
Escape
Sleep 500ms

Type "q"
Sleep 1s
